      <title>一个残酷的现实：你以为在商量，其实只是在通知</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260909/%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%AE%8B%E9%85%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%A0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%95%86%E9%87%8F%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5/</link>
